<h1>Which Person Quoted what in Stranger Things</h1>
<h2><a href = "/people/index">About</a></h2> <h2><a href = "/people/all">All People</a></h2>

<h2>How this Page works</h2>
<p>This database uses two main sources, Faker and Stranger Things Quotes.</p>
<p>The people within the database are generated via Faker</p>
<p>Stranger Things Quotes is used as the base for generating the quotes the people will say</p>
<p>Once the quotes are generated, then people are generated using Faker and given one of the quotes</p>
<h2>See one of the Results Here</h2>

<div id="products">
  <% @people.each do |person| %>
    <div>
        <h3>Person: <%= person.name %></h3>
        <% quote = person.quote %>
        <h3>Said: <%= quote.saying %></h3>
        <h4>At: <%= person.said_at %></h4>
    </div>
    <br />
  <% end %>
</div>